Release ietms for the 2026 H2 release
* Support remote SSH access. We can enable the ssh port in the jupyter server UI.
* Support public service to the external internet. This can be configured in the account manager.
* Use the open code to manager the services in a chatbot via MCP and skills.
* Make announcements in the account manager
* Support shared folder to shared data within the entire cluster or group.
* Improve cost report. We can access the cost inside the account manager without using the grafana.
